          "Japanese": "うーん、悪い話じゃないけど…\n１％ずつの交換でいいの？",
          "current_English": "Hmm... Not a bad deal. \n Is one percent each okay? "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1272,
          "current_command_offset": 1136,
          "source_offset": 1277,
          "current_offset": 1141,
          "source_record_index": 132,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a882c182c6814182bb82a482cd82a282a982cb82a60a838a8358837b839382cd91e593738e7382be82b581418cf092ca82cc834a836983810a82be82a982e782c88142825191ce825082aa82a282a282c682b182be82eb8148",
          "current_body_hex": "486f6c64206f6e2e204c6973626f6e27732061206269672063697479200a20616e642061206d616a6f72206875622e2054776f20746f206f6e650a20697320746865206265737420796f75276c6c206765742e20",
          "Japanese": "おっと、そうはいかねえ\nリスボンは大都市だし、交通のカナメ\nだからな。２対１がいいとこだろ？",
          "current_English": "Hold on. Lisbon's a big city \n and a major hub. Two to one\n is the best you'll get. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1370,
          "current_command_offset": 1228,
          "source_offset": 1375,
          "current_offset": 1233,
          "source_record_index": 136,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82b182c182bf82aa83698393836782cc8251819382f096be82af936e82b582bd82e70a82bb82c182bf82aa838a8358837b839382cc8250819382f082ad82ea82e982c182c40a82ed82af8148",
          "current_body_hex": "536f207765206769766520796f7520322070657263656e74206f66204e616e746573200a20666f7220312070657263656e74206f66204c6973626f6e3f20",
          "Japanese": "こっちがナントの２％を明け渡したら\nそっちがリスボンの１％をくれるって\nわけ？",
          "current_English": "So we give you 2 percent of Nantes \n for 1 percent of Lisbon? "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1454,
          "current_command_offset": 1298,
          "source_offset": 1459,
          "current_offset": 1303,
          "source_record_index": 140,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a482f1",
          "current_body_hex": "5965732e",
          "Japanese": "うん",
          "current_English": "Yes."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1466,
          "current_command_offset": 1310,
          "source_offset": 1471,
          "current_offset": 1315,
          "source_record_index": 145,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "8343838482c882e795ca82c982a282a282f182be82ba0a91bc82f082a082bd82e982a982e782e6",
          "current_body_hex": "496620796f7520646f6e27742077616e7420746865206465616c2c2066696e652e0a205765276c6c2061736b20736f6d656f6e6520656c73652e20",
          "Japanese": "イヤなら別にいいんだぜ\n他をあたるからよ",
          "current_English": "If you don't want the deal, fine.\n We'll ask someone else. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1512,
          "current_command_offset": 1376,
          "source_offset": 1517,
          "current_offset": 1381,
          "source_record_index": 148,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c782a482a982c88148",
          "current_body_hex": "5768617420646f20796f75207468696e6b3f",
          "Japanese": "どうかな？",
          "current_English": "What do you think?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1530,
          "current_command_offset": 1402,
          "source_offset": 1536,
          "current_offset": 1408,
          "source_record_index": 155,
          "native_command_word": 8448,
          "selector": null,
          "slots": [
            0
          ],
          "source_body_hex": "82a4815b82f18163814182a282a282ed82e6",
          "current_body_hex": "486d6d2e2e2e2066696e652c207468656e2e",
          "Japanese": "うーん…、いいわよ",
          "current_English": "Hmm... fine, then."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1530,
          "current_command_offset": 1402,
          "source_offset": 1556,
          "current_offset": 1428,
          "source_record_index": 157,
          "native_command_word": 8448,
          "selector": null,
          "slots": [
            1
          ],
          "source_body_hex": "836f8362834a82b682e182c882a282cc8148",
          "current_body_hex": "41726520796f75206e7574733f",
          "Japanese": "バッカじゃないの？",
          "current_English": "Are you nuts?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1584,
          "current_command_offset": 1450,
          "source_offset": 1589,
          "current_offset": 1455,
          "source_record_index": 164,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a082f182bd82cc82a882da82c182bf82e182dc8ae78ca982c482bd82e70a82c7815b82c582e082e682ad82c882c182c482ab82bd82ed8163",
          "current_body_hex": "546861742070616d706572656420666163652e2e2e204f682c2077686f2063617265730a2061626f757420746865207465726d733f",
          "Japanese": "あんたのおぼっちゃま顔見てたら\nどーでもよくなってきたわ…",
          "current_English": "That pampered face... Oh, who cares\n about the terms?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1648,
          "current_command_offset": 1510,
          "source_offset": 1653,
          "current_offset": 1515,
          "source_record_index": 167,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82dc8141926e92868a4382c98f6f82e982cc82c9838a8358837b839382f00a92ca82e782c882a282ed82af82c982cd82a282a982c882a282b582cb",
          "current_body_hex": "426573696465732c207765206861766520746f2070617373204c6973626f6e0a20746f20726561636820746865204d65646974657272616e65616e2e20",
          "Japanese": "ま、地中海に出るのにリスボンを\n通らないわけにはいかないしね",
          "current_English": "Besides, we have to pass Lisbon\n to reach the Mediterranean. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1714,
          "current_command_offset": 1578,
          "source_offset": 1719,
          "current_offset": 1583,
          "source_record_index": 170,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "8fa4926b90ac97a782be82cb8149",
          "current_body_hex": "4465616c2120",
          "Japanese": "商談成立だね！",
          "current_English": "Deal! "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1736,
          "current_command_offset": 1592,
          "source_offset": 1741,
          "current_offset": 1597,
          "source_record_index": 175,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82e682b5814182b182ea82c5966b8a4390698f6f82cc91ab82aa82a982e882aa0a82c582ab82bd82ba8149",
          "current_body_hex": "477265617421204120666f6f74686f6c6420696e20746865204e6f7274682053656121",
          "Japanese": "よし、これで北海進出の足がかりが\nできたぜ！",
          "current_English": "Great! A foothold in the North Sea!"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1786,
          "current_command_offset": 1634,
          "source_offset": 1791,
          "current_offset": 1639,
          "source_record_index": 178,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a082e882aa82c682a48141464982b382f181490a82b182ea82a982e782e082e682eb82b582ad8149",
          "current_body_hex": "5468616e6b20796f752c204649210a2049206c6f6f6b20666f727761726420746f20776f726b696e67207769746820796f7521",
          "Japanese": "ありがとう、FIさん！\nこれからもよろしく！",
          "current_English": "Thank you, FI!\n I look forward to working with you!"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1874,
          "current_command_offset": 1732,
          "source_offset": 1879,
          "current_offset": 1737,
          "source_record_index": 190,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 254,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "83698393836782c6838a8358837b839382cc83568346834182f00a8cf08ab782b582dc82b582bd",
          "current_body_hex": "4d61726b65742073686172657320696e204e616e74657320616e64204c6973626f6e200a2068617665206265656e2065786368616e6765642e",
          "Japanese": "ナントとリスボンのシェアを\n交換しました",
          "current_English": "Market shares in Nantes and Lisbon \n have been exchanged."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1924,
          "current_command_offset": 1800,
          "source_offset": 1929,
          "current_offset": 1805,
          "source_record_index": 194,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82d382f182c10a82bb82f182c88cfb8ed482c982cd8fe682e782c882a282f182be82a982e7",
          "current_body_hex": "486d7068212049276d206e6f742066616c6c696e670a20666f72207468617420736d6f6f74682074616c6b2120",
          "Japanese": "ふんっ\nそんな口車には乗らないんだから",
          "current_English": "Hmph! I'm not falling\n for that smooth talk! "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 1968,
          "current_command_offset": 1852,
          "source_offset": 1973,
          "current_offset": 1857,
          "source_record_index": 197,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a4815b82f18141835f838182a982a00a82a282a28ff08c8f82be82c68e7682c182bd82f182be82af82c78163",
          "current_body_hex": "4f682e2e2e20546f6f206261642e205365656d6564206661697220746f206d652e",
          "Japanese": "うーん、ダメかあ\nいい条件だと思ったんだけど…",
          "current_English": "Oh... Too bad. Seemed fair to me."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 2020,
          "current_command_offset": 1892,
          "source_offset": 2025,
          "current_offset": 1897,
          "source_record_index": 201,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82b582e582a482aa82cb82a682c8814291bc82f082a082bd82e982a9",
          "current_body_hex": "4f682077656c6c2e204c657427732061736b20736f6d656f6e6520656c73652e",
          "Japanese": "しょうがねえな。他をあたるか",
          "current_English": "Oh well. Let's ask someone else."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 2056,
          "current_command_offset": 1932,
          "source_offset": 2061,
          "current_offset": 1937,
          "source_record_index": 205,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82e082a482a282a282e68141834e838983458142906c82f082a082c482c982b782e90a82c882f182c4814182e282c182cf82e8928e82aa82e682b782ac82bd82f182be0a8ea995aa82bd82bf82c5835283638352836382e282c182c482a282ad82cc82aa0a88ea94d482be82e6",
          "current_body_hex": "4974277320616c6c2072696768742c20436c617564696f2e200a20576520776572652061736b696e6720746f6f206d7563682c20636f756e74696e670a206f6e206f74686572732e20576527726520626574746572206f66660a20776f726b696e67207374656164696c79206f6e206f7572206f776e2e",
          "Japanese": "もういいよ、クラウ。人をあてにする\nなんて、やっぱり虫がよすぎたんだ\n自分たちでコツコツやっていくのが\n一番だよ",
          "current_English": "It's all right, Claudio. \n We were asking too much, counting\n on others. We're better off\n working steadily on our own."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 2172,
          "current_command_offset": 2058,
          "source_offset": 2177,
          "current_offset": 2063,
          "source_record_index": 209,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82bf82c10a82c782a482e0926e96a182c982a982b982ae82c182c482cc82cd0a89b482cc90ab95aa82c98d8782ed82cb82a682f182be82e682c882a0",
          "current_body_hex": "5463682e205468617420736c6f772c20737465616479200a20776179206f66206d616b696e67206d6f6e65790a206a7573742069736e2774206d79207374796c652e",
          "Japanese": "ちっ\nどうも地味にかせぐってのは\n俺の性分に合わねえんだよなあ",
          "current_English": "Tch. That slow, steady \n way of making money\n just isn't my style."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC2.DK4",
          "block": 133,
          "source_command_offset": 2242,
          "current_command_offset": 2134,
          "source_offset": 2247,
          "current_offset": 2139,
          "source_record_index": 213,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "95cf82c8906c82bd82bf8163",
          "current_body_hex": "4f646420706169722e2e2e20",
          "Japanese": "変な人たち…",
          "current_English": "Odd pair... "
        }
      ]
    }
